      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "鳥が出た！　象ほどもあるでっけえ鳥だ！\n場所は「ブロンテス湖」ってところなんだが\n子供たちが襲われた！\n誰かあいつを退治してくれ！　頼む！",
        "official_en": "The children were attacked by huge birds! They were\nas big as an elephant! They attacked us near Lake\nBrontes. Someone get rid of them! Please!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
