      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "退治してくれて、本当にありがとう！\n子供達は怯えちまって、小鳥を見ても逃げ出すんだ。\nでも、もう大丈夫だって伝えるよ。\nまた、元気になってくれるといいな。",
        "official_en": "Thank you so much for getting rid of those giant\nbeasts! The children are scared even of small birds.\nThey run for their lives when one lands nearby. But\nnow I can tell them that you saved the day.",
